{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_02_046_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:e0e32e3c6c1f7127504b48a623fa699a68800fc85cd598e344fb8d983edf8235",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_02_046_22:5_02_046_22_a:cmd-000011:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9b6876e7fb12620538f292ee54d19343ed84a220f3f11911e406e113484c1311",
      "text": "辛苦了。\n●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_046_22:5_02_046_22_a:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9cc2321349805a6bf76de68abcb3578d7919f3c66887de607d5e5a7a66cb3b41",
      "text": "我准备了白色情人节的回礼。\n愿意收下吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_046_22:5_02_046_22_a:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:81266b410ab26633a585970b005362a4d7856ecfd1250401d279ea324af37700",
      "text": "情人节的时候真的非常感谢。\n巧克力也非常美味。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_046_22:5_02_046_22_a:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef857630dc30e40518b03f4c5b5387d4c8bf0c905b1b61ee27171c028af34fcf",
      "text": "因为我也想向你传达这份心情，\n便挑选了这一份礼物。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_046_22:5_02_046_22_a:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef9db85d9329fabd06b81f5bd5d9ff5b9f33237465635e7a3d86dd8543ffad54",
      "text": "作为偶像我还是一介稚鱼，\n今后也请多多关照。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_046_22:5_02_046_22_b:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b507160b1d600769a6538b7ff93cd24db0faf16cbadf7238823f568bccaaf6ea",
      "text": "辛苦了。\n幸好您还在事务所，真是帮了大忙。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_046_22:5_02_046_22_b:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39e220743feaea59cf60f1edc5c51e12ea99da18ab5129f6037280ae648b421d",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，\n拖到这么晚才送来，实在很抱歉。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_046_22:5_02_046_22_b:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ce69c19107ac86b3a59e3979cb7ea5d79d2674dfa559f4f741fe3bde118daea",
      "text": "这个，是上个月巧克力的回礼。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_046_22:5_02_046_22_b:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:88666e634bd15b707439a49b9c80d40e7572253478446559b1429a7bf0e45fe5",
      "text": "什么样的东西才能让您开心，\n我着实伤透了脑筋。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_046_22:5_02_046_22_b:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:553a75f15fb2776159466451681ae2d84c4c725476641d4053c523e69f6b4072",
      "text": "我也曾找想乐和雨彦商量过，但他们说这种事\n最好还是由自己决定……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_046_22:5_02_046_22_b:cmd-000036:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:860595494f3f482d318360a02504c109c71c9291a49fc9a55a70e839647c358e",
      "text": "这份心意我就很高兴了！非常感谢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_046_22:5_02_046_22_b:cmd-000037:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:55c3ada5523e901a9c772e01f089a602d96ddb33fce6e767eee3c8196bcfbc0f",
      "text": "只要是克里斯先生送的，什么我都高兴哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_046_22:5_02_046_22_b:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f71b4222e46499ce85ac7158d587dc81f43ce4dfdc75d103e3ae3aede54e008c",
      "text": "能听您这么说真是荣幸之至。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_046_22:5_02_046_22_b:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:49fa8f52757369ee0a4e702327f145185e26aa2e4385defe7f418d44e24ce217",
      "text": "在无数的物品中，我终于寻觅到了\n想要赠予您的事物。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_046_22:5_02_046_22_b:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:09290fb578de2d6c62a8af6557685a490b72fd5af89d1e3964a927c323af5cda",
      "text": "简直宛如在广阔的大海中航行时与海鸟相遇一般。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_046_22:5_02_046_22_b:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b32fa61d8e831eab7580a80f3c6ca0e7cc3223b1e358d7d28fa1e80e59fefb05",
      "text": "今后也请多多关照呢，\n●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
